IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg8-nouns`
IMPORT `dg8-s264-merger-with-llcs`

-- Tests of section 264 (merger or consolidation of domestic corporations and limited liability companies).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the text of section 264 (src:1302-1325) and written here before running; none was copied from the code's output.

§ `Builders`

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 264(b) Statements in the agreement of merger or consolidation`
`t264 agreement statements` a b c d e f g MEANS
    `s 264(b) Statements in the agreement of merger or consolidation` WITH
        `s 264(b)(1) the agreement states the terms and conditions of the merger or consolidation` IS a
        , `s 264(b)(2) the agreement states the mode of carrying the merger or consolidation into effect` IS b
        , `s 264(b)(3) the agreement states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation shall be its certificate of incorporation` IS c
        , `s 264(b)(4) the agreement states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the agreement` IS d
        , `s 264(b)(5) the agreement states the manner, if any, of converting the shares of stock and the limited liability company interests into securities of the surviving or resulting entity, or of cancelling some or all of them` IS e
        , `s 264(b)(5) the agreement states the cash, property, rights or securities of any other corporation or entity that the holders of shares or interests not to remain outstanding are to receive` IS f
        , `s 264(b)(7) the agreement sets out the other provisions or facts that the laws of each jurisdiction under which any of the limited liability companies are formed require` IS g

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 264(c) Approvals of the agreement`
`t264 approvals` a b MEANS
    `s 264(c) Approvals of the agreement` WITH
        `s 264(c) each corporation has adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged the agreement in the same manner as is provided in § 251 or § 255` IS a
        , `s 264(c) each limited liability company has adopted, approved, certified, executed and acknowledged the agreement in accordance with its limited liability company agreement and the laws of the jurisdiction under which it is formed` IS b

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A BOOLEAN, f IS A BOOLEAN, g IS A BOOLEAN, h IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 264(c) Statements in the certificate of merger or consolidation`
`t264 certificate statements` a b c d e f g h MEANS
    `s 264(c) Statements in the certificate of merger or consolidation` WITH
        `s 264(c)(1) the certificate states the name and jurisdiction of formation or organization of each of the constituent entities` IS a
        , `s 264(c)(2) the certificate states that an agreement of merger or consolidation has been approved, adopted, certified, executed and acknowledged by each of the constituent entities in accordance with the subsection` IS b
        , `s 264(c)(3) the certificate states the name of the surviving or resulting corporation or limited liability company` IS c
        , `s 264(c)(4) the certificate states the amendments or changes in the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation, or that its certificate of incorporation shall be its certificate of incorporation` IS d
        , `s 264(c)(5) the certificate states that the certificate of incorporation of the resulting corporation shall be as set forth in an attachment to the certificate` IS e
        , `s 264(c)(6) the certificate states that the executed agreement is on file at an office of the surviving or resulting corporation or limited liability company and the address of that office` IS f
        , `s 264(c)(7) the certificate states that a copy of the agreement will be furnished, on request and without cost, to any stockholder of any constituent corporation or any member of any constituent limited liability company` IS g
        , `s 264(c)(8) the certificate states the agreement, if any, required by subsection (d)` IS h

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A BOOLEAN, c IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 264(d) Statements in the agreement to be served with process`
`t264 service agreement` a b c d MEANS
    `s 264(d) Statements in the agreement to be served with process` WITH
        `s 264(d) the limited liability company agrees that it may be served with process in this State in any proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of any constituent corporation or limited liability company of this State` IS a
        , `s 264(d) the limited liability company agrees that it may be served with process in this State in any proceeding for enforcement of any obligation of the surviving or resulting limited liability company arising from the merger or consolidation, including any suit or other proceeding to enforce the right of any stockholders as determined in appraisal proceedings pursuant to § 262` IS b
        , `s 264(d) the limited liability company irrevocably appoints the Secretary of State as its agent to accept service of process in any such suit or other proceedings` IS c
        , `s 264(d) the limited liability company specifies the address to which a copy of such process shall be mailed by the Secretary of State` IS d

§ `s 264(a)`

-- Text: "limited liability company" in this section includes any limited liability company formed under the laws of this State or of any other jurisdiction;
-- a partnership of any kind, a corporation of any kind, a natural person, a trust and a joint-stock association are not limited liability companies.
#ASSERT `s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a limited liability company`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a general partnership`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a limited partnership`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a limited liability partnership`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a limited liability limited partnership`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` (`a corporation` `a stock corporation`))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a natural person`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a statutory trust`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) the term limited liability company` `a joint-stock association`)

-- Text: "Any 1 or more corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with 1 or more limited liability companies, unless the laws of the jurisdiction ... prohibit".
-- 1 corporation and 1 limited liability company is the smallest case that works; none of either does not; a prohibition by the limited liability company's own law stops it.
#ASSERT `s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 1 1 FALSE
#ASSERT `s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 3 2 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 0 1 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 1 0 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 0 0 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 1 1 TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(a) corporations of this State may merge or consolidate with limited liability companies` 2 2 TRUE)

§ `s 264(b)`

-- Text, (b)(1)-(7): the agreement states the terms (1), the mode (2), for a merger into a surviving corporation the certificate changes (3), for a consolidation
-- into a resulting corporation the attached certificate (4), the manner of converting or cancelling (5), the consideration where shares do not remain outstanding (5),
-- and what each limited liability company's jurisdiction requires (7). Arguments: entered in writing, form, some not outstanding, holders receive other consideration, the statements (1 2 3 4 5a 5b 7).
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- not entered into in writing by each constituent
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` FALSE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
-- (1) missing, (2) missing, (5) first limb missing, (7) missing
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- (3) is required only where the merger ends in a surviving corporation of this State
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a consolidation into a new resulting entity that is not a corporation` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- (4) is required only where the consolidation ends in a resulting corporation of this State
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State` FALSE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
-- (5) second limb: required only where some shares or interests do not remain outstanding AND the holders receive other consideration
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE TRUE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE TRUE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE FALSE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the agreement of merger or consolidation is as the subsection requires` TRUE `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE TRUE (`t264 agreement statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)

-- Text, (b)(6): "such other details or provisions as are deemed desirable, including ... cash in lieu of ... fractional shares ... consistent with § 155".
#ASSERT `s 264(b)(6) the detail or provision may be included in the agreement` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 264(b)(6) the detail or provision may be included in the agreement` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b)(6) the detail or provision may be included in the agreement` TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b)(6) the detail or provision may be included in the agreement` FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b)(6) the detail or provision may be included in the agreement` FALSE TRUE TRUE)

-- Text, the paragraph after (b)(7): a term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the agreement "provided that the manner in which such facts shall operate ... is clearly and expressly set forth".
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the agreement` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the agreement` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the agreement` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(b) the term may depend on facts ascertainable outside the agreement` TRUE FALSE)

§ `s 264(c)`

-- Text, first sentence: approval by each corporation (as in section 251 or 255) and by each limited liability company (under its agreement and law).
-- Section 264(c) has no sentence requiring approval by a stockholder who becomes a general partner (compare section 263(c)). Arguments to the approvals builder: corporations, companies.
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the agreement has the approvals the subsection requires` (`t264 approvals` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the agreement has the approvals the subsection requires` (`t264 approvals` FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the agreement has the approvals the subsection requires` (`t264 approvals` TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the agreement has the approvals the subsection requires` (`t264 approvals` FALSE FALSE))

-- Text, third sentence: filed, and effective for all purposes of the laws of this State when and as section 251 or 255 provides. The day the merger becomes effective is an input.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the merger or consolidation is effective for all purposes of the laws of this State` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 7 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 6 30))
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the merger or consolidation is effective for all purposes of the laws of this State` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 7 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 7 1)
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the merger or consolidation is effective for all purposes of the laws of this State` TRUE (YearMonthDay 2026 7 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 7 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the merger or consolidation is effective for all purposes of the laws of this State` FALSE (YearMonthDay 2026 7 1) (YearMonthDay 2026 7 2))

-- Text, (c)(1)-(8): the certificate filed in lieu of the agreement. Arguments to the builder: statements (1) to (8). (4) is for a merger into a surviving corporation, (5) for a consolidation
-- into a resulting corporation, (8) where subsection (d) requires an agreement (a surviving or resulting limited liability company formed outside this State).
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- a consolidation into a resulting corporation: (5) required, (4) not
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- a surviving or resulting limited liability company: (4) and (5) are not asked for; (8) is asked for only when the limited liability company is formed outside this State
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` FALSE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a consolidation into a new resulting entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
-- (8) is not asked for of a surviving corporation, whatever the flag says
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate states what the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE (`t264 certificate statements` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- Text: executed "in accordance with § 103 ... if the surviving or resulting entity is a corporation, or by an authorized person, if ... a limited liability company".
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation of this State` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate is executed as the subsection requires` `a consolidation into a new resulting entity that is not a corporation` FALSE TRUE

-- Text: "In lieu of filing the agreement ... may file a certificate ... which states": executed as required and stating what is required.
#ASSERT `s 264(c) the certificate of merger or consolidation may be filed in lieu of the agreement` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate of merger or consolidation may be filed in lieu of the agreement` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c) the certificate of merger or consolidation may be filed in lieu of the agreement` FALSE TRUE)

-- Text, (c)(7): a copy "will be furnished ... on request and without cost, to any stockholder of any constituent corporation or any member of any constituent limited liability company".
#ASSERT `s 264(c)(7) the person may have a copy of the agreement on request and without cost` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(c)(7) the person may have a copy of the agreement on request and without cost` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(c)(7) the person may have a copy of the agreement on request and without cost` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c)(7) the person may have a copy of the agreement on request and without cost` FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(c)(7) the person may have a copy of the agreement on request and without cost` TRUE FALSE FALSE)

§ `s 264(d)`

-- Text: if the survivor "is a limited liability company formed under the laws of a jurisdiction other than this State, it shall agree that it may be served with process in this State".
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company must agree to be served with process in this State` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company must agree to be served with process in this State` `a consolidation into a new resulting entity that is not a corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company must agree to be served with process in this State` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company must agree to be served with process in this State` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE)

-- Text: the agreement has four limbs: service for obligations of a constituent of this State; service for the survivor's obligations arising from the merger (including appraisal);
-- the irrevocable appointment of the Secretary of State; the address. Arguments to the builder: the four statements.
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 service agreement` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 service agreement` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 service agreement` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 service agreement` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE (`t264 service agreement` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE))
-- no agreement is asked for where the limited liability company is formed in this State, or the survivor is a corporation
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` FALSE (`t264 service agreement` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the surviving or resulting limited liability company has agreed as the subsection requires` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE (`t264 service agreement` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)

-- The claimant's side: process may be served on the Secretary of State in a proceeding of the kinds the agreement covers.
#ASSERT `s 264(d) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the surviving or resulting limited liability company` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the surviving or resulting limited liability company` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the surviving or resulting limited liability company` `a merger into a surviving entity that is not a corporation` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) process may be served on the Secretary of State as agent of the surviving or resulting limited liability company` `a merger into a surviving corporation of this State` TRUE TRUE)

-- Text: "Process may be served upon the Secretary of State ... by means of electronic transmission but only as prescribed by the Secretary of State."
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the means of serving process on the Secretary of State is permitted` FALSE TRUE

-- Text: "the Secretary of State shall forthwith notify ... by letter".
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the Secretary of State must forthwith notify the surviving or resulting limited liability company by letter` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the Secretary of State must forthwith notify the surviving or resulting limited liability company by letter` FALSE)

-- Text: the letter goes to the address specified, unless a different address was designated in writing, in which case to "the last address so designated".
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` "1 Main Street" EMPTY EQUALS "1 Main Street"
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` "1 Main Street" (LIST "2 Oak Avenue") EQUALS "2 Oak Avenue"
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the address to which the Secretary of State must mail the letter` "1 Main Street" (LIST "2 Oak Avenue", "3 Pine Road", "4 Elm Court") EQUALS "4 Elm Court"

-- Text: mail or courier service with a record of mailing or deposit and a record of delivery evidenced by the recipient's signature; and the letter encloses a copy of the process and papers.
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the letter is sent as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE)

-- Text: "It shall be the duty of the plaintiff ... to serve process and any other papers in duplicate, to notify the Secretary of State ... and to pay the Secretary of State a fee".
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the plaintiff has done what the subsection requires of a plaintiff` TRUE TRUE FALSE)

-- Text: the fee "shall be taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding, if the plaintiff shall prevail therein".
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the fee is taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the fee is taxed as part of the costs in the proceeding` FALSE)

-- Text: not required to retain "longer than 5 years from receipt". Received 1 March 2020: the fifth anniversary (1 March 2025) is still inside the five years; the day after is not.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2025 2 28))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2025 3 1))
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 3 1) (YearMonthDay 2025 3 2)
-- Received on a leap day, 29 February 2020: five years on is 28 February 2025 (core fork F2, the date arithmetic clamps), so 1 March 2025 is outside.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 2 29) (YearMonthDay 2025 2 28))
#ASSERT `s 264(d) the Secretary of State is no longer required to retain the record of service` (YearMonthDay 2020 2 29) (YearMonthDay 2025 3 1)

§ `s 264(e)`

-- Text: sections 251(d)-(f), 255(c) (second sentence) and (d)-(f), 259-261 and 328 "shall, insofar as they are applicable, apply".
#ASSERT count (`s 264(e) the provisions that apply to mergers or consolidations between corporations and limited liability companies`) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `s 264(e) the provision applies to the merger or consolidation` `s 251(d) to (f) as applied by s 264(e)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(e) the provision applies to the merger or consolidation` `s 255(c) second sentence and (d) to (f) as applied by s 264(e)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(e) the provision applies to the merger or consolidation` `ss 259 to 261 as applied by s 264(e)` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(e) the provision applies to the merger or consolidation` `s 328 as applied by s 264(e)` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(e) the provision applies to the merger or consolidation` `s 328 as applied by s 264(e)` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(e) the provision applies to the merger or consolidation` `ss 259 to 261 as applied by s 264(e)` FALSE)

§ `s 264(f)`

-- Text: nothing authorizes the merger of a charitable nonstock corporation into a limited liability company if its charitable status would thereby be lost or impaired;
-- but a limited liability company may be merged into a charitable nonstock corporation which continues as the surviving corporation.
#ASSERT `s 264(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the limited liability company` `a charitable nonstock corporation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the limited liability company` `a charitable nonstock corporation` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the limited liability company` `a charitable nonstock corporation` FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the limited liability company` `a stock corporation` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the limited liability company` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the section does not authorize the merger of the charitable nonstock corporation into the limited liability company` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 264(f) the limited liability company may be merged into the charitable nonstock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the limited liability company may be merged into the charitable nonstock corporation` `a charitable nonstock corporation` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 264(f) the limited liability company may be merged into the charitable nonstock corporation` `a stock corporation` TRUE)

§ `The meaning of "facts" (s 264(b))`

-- Text (src:1312): the term "facts" "includes, but is not limited to, the occurrence of any event, including a determination or action by any person or body, including the corporation".
-- An event, a determination by any person or body and an action by any person or body are facts; for anything else the text does not say (NOTHING; fork F26).
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `the occurrence of an event under s 264(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `a determination by any person or body, including the corporation, under s 264(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `an action by any person or body, including the corporation, under s 264(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 264(b) the kind of fact is within the term facts` `something that is neither an event, a determination nor an action under s 264(b)` EQUALS NOTHING
